{"id":"bcoaojzvvveyot9nqppddygx6","title":"Coinbase获美国信托牌照，参议院调查加密监管升温","originalTitle":"美国监管推进加密信托牌照，参议院调查升温","summary":"Coinbase宣布获得美国全国性信托牌照，为其托管业务提供统一联邦监管框架。美国货币监理署此前于4月给予初步批准。立法者要求查看牌照审批记录，并持续质疑监管机构如何扩大加密企业业务范围。参议员Elizabeth Warren于5月18日致信货币监理署，要求披露与特朗普政府相关人员往来。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"链捕手 ChainCatcher"},"links":{"original":"https://www.chaincatcher.com/article/2304638"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-13T21:00:53.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-13T21:07:40.694Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-13T21:07:40.694Z","category":"crypto-policy","tags":["监管处罚","政策发布","Coinbase"],"score":84,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":null,"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[],"topics":[{"slug":"coinbase","name":"Coinbase"},{"slug":"regulation","name":"监管与政策"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":null,"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}